          "tool": "official.lookup",
          "call": "Fetched the preceding official March 2026 Employment Insurance release for matching Canada seasonally adjusted totals.",
          "result": "The March release reports 548,000 beneficiaries, up 2,300 (+0.4%) from February after February fell 8,700 (-1.6%); this implies January 554,400 and February 545,700 on the published first-release sequence."
