          "call": "Fetched Statistics Canada's May 2026 Labour Force Survey as a contemporaneous public labour-market indicator.",
          "result": "May employment was 21,122,000, up 88,000 (+0.4%), while the unemployment rate fell 0.3 percentage points to 6.6%; this is a modest downward adjustment to near-term beneficiary pressure."
