          "text": "Prior/update/interval: persistence prior is latest-value persistence at 1.814 million, with a reference class of the five fetched same-variant DOL values from May 23 through June 20. I add +0.004 million for recent upward continued-claims momentum, +0.003 million for weak hiring/longer-duration risk, and -0.001 million for low initial-claims inflow, giving 1.820 million. Interval method uses realized dispersion of successive same-variant changes; sigma = 0.006 million from changes +0.015, +0.014, +0.012, and +0.002, so 1.28*sigma = 0.008 million. I widen modestly to about 0.010 million because the target week is near the July 4 seasonal-adjustment period and because weak payroll revisions raise duration risk."
